  "bodyHash": "99058386c6c0c616",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/plasmoapp/plasmo-voice/releases/latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/plasmoapp/plasmo-voice.svg\" alt=\"最新發行版本\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/uueEqzwCJJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://img.shields.io/discord/833693644501286993?label=Discord&style=flat&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/3ccgCRz.png\" alt=\"Plasmo Voice 標誌\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fplasmo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/plasmoapp/plasmo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplasmovoice.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplasmovoice.com%252fdocs%252faddons%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">外掛模組</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fuueEqzwCJJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/plasmomc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p>\n<h2>支援所有主流平台</h2>\n<p>Paper、Folia、Fabric、Forge 與 NeoForge 伺服器完全相容於 Fabric 和 Forge 用戶端。</p>\n<p>要使用語音通話，玩家必須安裝 <strong>Fabric</strong>、<strong>Forge</strong> 或 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 的用戶端模組。\n沒有安裝此模組的玩家仍可加入伺服器並正常遊玩，只是無法使用語音通話功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/compatability-chart.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><em>假設用戶端與伺服器均已安裝 Plasmo Voice。</em></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/hud-icons.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/player-icons.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/voice-settings.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/visualise-distance.gif\" width=\"1280px\" alt=\"語音通話近距離效果與設定示範\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/rmb-scroll.gif\" width=\"1280px\" alt=\"語音通話介面與操作示範\"></p>\n<h2>用戶端功能</h2>\n<p><strong>音質與處理</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>RNNoise 降噪</li>\n<li>採用 OpenAL 音效引擎，提供優異的 3D 定位</li>\n<li>立體聲音源</li>\n<li>平滑音量過渡</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>沉浸感與真實感</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>可選的聲音遮蔽（透過方塊使聲音變悶）</li>\n<li>可選的方向性音源（說話者未面向你時聲音較小）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsound-physics-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sound Physics Remastered</a> 相容搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-soundphysics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-soundphysics</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>操作與互動</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>可調整語音通話距離</li>\n<li>可在「按鍵通話」與「聲控」之間選擇</li>\n<li>注視玩家時按住 <strong>滑鼠右鍵</strong>，並使用滾輪調整其音量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>裝置與介面</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>選擇輸入與輸出音訊裝置</li>\n<li>可自訂 GUI 圖示位置</li>\n<li>切換玩家圖示顯示/隱藏</li>\n<li>類似 Discord 的遊戲內覆蓋介面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/landing/keybindings.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>按下 <code>V</code> 即可查看語音設定。<em>請確保已選取正確的裝置，且麥克風運作正常。</em></p>\n<h2>伺服器功能</h2>\n<p><strong>音訊與效能</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>採用 Opus 編解碼器，低頻寬消耗且高音質</li>\n<li>可調整語音通話距離</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>管理與控制</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>透過聊天指令在伺服器端禁言</li>\n<li>可設定踢出未安裝用戶端模組的玩家</li>\n<li>權限系統支援</li>\n<li>隱身模式支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相容性與網路</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>支援單人遊戲與對區域網路開放</li>\n<li>支援 BungeeCord 與 Velocity</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>整合與擴充性</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>PlaceholderAPI 支援</li>\n<li>進階 API</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安全性</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>加密語音通訊</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>伺服器端外掛模組</h2>\n<p>通用外掛模組適用於 Fabric、Forge、NeoForge 與 Paper。</p>\n<p><em>另請參閱：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplasmovoice.com%252fdocs%252faddons%252ftypes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">外掛模組類型</a>。</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>圖示</th>\n<th>外掛模組</th>\n<th>說明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-groups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/groups.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-groups\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-groups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-groups</a></td>\n<td>建立群組語音頻道。即使與遠處的玩家也能持續通話</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-sculk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/skulk.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-sculk\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-sculk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-sculk</a></td>\n<td>安裝此外掛後，監守者與幽匿感測器會因近距離語音通話而觸發</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-broadcast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/broadcast.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-broadcast\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-broadcast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-broadcast</a></td>\n<td>將你的聲音廣播至半徑、世界、伺服器或代理中的所有玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-spectator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/spectator.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-spectator\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-spectator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-spectator</a></td>\n<td>安裝此外掛後，所有玩家都能聽見觀察者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-whisper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/whisper.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-whisper\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-whisper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-whisper</a></td>\n<td>預設情況下，耳語距離為當前近距離通話距離的一半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-priority\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/priority.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-priority\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-priority\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-priority</a></td>\n<td>聲控功能，提供更遠且可調整的距離</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-lavaplayer-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/lava_player.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-lavaplayer-lib\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-lavaplayer-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-lavaplayer-lib</a></td>\n<td>此外掛包含部分 Plasmo Voice 外掛所需的 LavaPlayer 分支函式庫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-discs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/discs.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-discs\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-discs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-discs</a></td>\n<td>在 Minecraft 中使用音樂唱片播放來自 YouTube 及其他來源的音訊。支援串流與直播（YouTube、Twitch）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>用戶端外掛模組</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>圖示</th>\n<th>外掛模組</th>\n<th>說明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/sound_physics.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-soundphysics\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pv-addon-soundphysics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-soundphysics</a></td>\n<td>新增與 Sound Physics Remastered 的相容性。Plasmo Voice 會受到聲音物理效果影響</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-replaymod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://plasmovoice.com/addon_logo/replaymod.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-replaymod\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-replaymod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-replaymod</a></td>\n<td>Replay Voice Chat 的分支版本，可與 Plasmo Voice 搭配使用，並允許使用 ReplayMod 錄製語音通話</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-flashback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apehum/pv-addon-flashback/refs/heads/main/src/main/resources/assets/pvaddonflashback/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" alt=\"pv-addon-flashback\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpv-addon-flashback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pv-addon-flashback</a></td>\n<td>安裝此外掛後，Plasmo Voice 的語音通話將被記錄在 Flashback 回放中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/talkingheads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads/refs/heads/master/src/main/resources/icon/icon.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"Talking Heads\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/talkingheads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Talking Heads</a></td>\n<td>玩家說話時，頭部模型會隨語音大小縮放<br><em>第三方外掛。問題請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/TalkingHeads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Talking Heads GitHub</a> 回報。</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-them-talk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZipeStudio/Let-Them-Talk/refs/heads/master/src/main/resources/icon/icon.png\" width=\"96\" alt=\"Let Them Talk (LTT)\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-them-talk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let Them Talk (LTT)</a></td>\n<td>有人說話時自動降低音樂與其他應用程式的音量<br><em>第三方外掛。問題請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Let-Them-Talk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let Them Talk (LTT) GitHub</a> 回報。</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>下載</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fplasmo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Modrinth 下載 Plasmo Voice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plasmo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 CurseForge 下載 Plasmo Voice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/plasmoapp/plasmo-voice/releases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">發行版本</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>文件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplasmovoice.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件</a></li>\n</ul>",
